DegenLens champion-derived scorer candidates

The following artifacts are derived from Telegraph scorer binaries published
by zkasuran under the MIT License before the repository's 2026-08-30 license
change:

- dist/degenlens_onchain_tx_lookup_v14.wasm
- dist/degenlens_fraud_detection_v10.wasm
